From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 28 Sep 2026 07:22:44 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 12/15] perf(trafficcraft): reuse traffic-light bulb model
 lookups

Each bulb of each traffic light searched TrafficCraft's model list with a
stream on every frame. Remember the model that search returns for each
icon/color pair (key equality compares only those two values, and the list
is filled once in the static initializer) and draw later bulbs with that
same model object through TrafficCraft's own render method. Client only.

